OL,3,GNEWSACovid tiles 'an expression of
OL,4,Agrief and healing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies in Stoke-on-Trent who lost
OL,7,Floved ones during the Covid pandemic
OL,8,Fhave been creating ceramic tiles in
OL,9,Ftheir memory.
OL,11,FThe individual tributes will be
OL,12,Fincorporated into a permanent ceramic
OL,13,Fmemorial bench which is set to be
OL,14,Finstalled in Hanley's Bethesda Gardens
OL,15,Fin 2027.
OL,17,FLynn Jones MBE campaigned for a
OL,18,Fmemorial following the death of her
OL,19,Fhusband Gareth Jones, in 2021, and
OL,20,Fdescribed the process of tile making as
OL,21,F"in itself an expression of grief and
OL,22,Fhealing."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
