OL,3,GNEWSACovid tiles 'an expression of
OL,4,Agrief and healing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first creative session was at Spode
OL,7,FWorks in Stoke, which Jones said was a
OL,8,Fwonderful location for it "because it
OL,9,Funites the grief and the local
OL,10,Fcharacter of Stoke-on-Trent, which is
OL,11,Four ceramics industry."
